sequenceDiagram
    participant Operador
    participant UI as Web TelegramBridge
    participant API as ChatApiController
    participant Storage as TelegramAttachmentStorage
    participant Bot as TelegramBotApiClient
    participant TG as Telegram Bot API
    participant Hub as TelegramChatHub

    Operador->>UI: Escreve mensagem e seleciona anexo
    UI->>API: POST /api/chats/{chatId}/messages (multipart)
    API->>Storage: SavePanelFilesAsync(chatId, files)
    Storage-->>API: Arquivos persistidos + metadata
    API->>Bot: SendMessageAsync(chatId, texto, anexos)
    Bot->>TG: sendPhoto/sendDocument/sendVideo
    TG-->>Bot: ok
    Bot-->>API: envio concluido
    API->>Hub: BroadcastConversationMessageAsync
    Hub-->>UI: ReceiveConversationMessage
    UI-->>Operador: Mensagem renderizada na bolha (realtime)
